                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Waited so long, and wasn't dissapointed by it.\nGet this game!\n\nVilleTown is a hard strategy, town-management game where you have to assign your people to different jobs and guiding them through the seasons while having to deal with several threats, physically and psychologically.\nThe game seems simple, the quite and peaceful gameplay can turn into a hell-like disaster with starving and dying people in just a couple of seconds if you've made the wrong choices..\n\nEveryone who likes the challenge of leading a town and defending it from several threats will definetely like this game.\n\nYou've to give it a couple of minutes to understand it, but once you're in, you dont want to leave that quick.\n\n8/10 - \"Seems simple, but can f**k you in just a couple of seconds\". :)",
